#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/libarchive.rst:15
msgid "``libArchive``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/libarchive.rst:17
msgid "*Optional* | Type: ``Boolean``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/libarchive.rst:19
msgid ""
"Create an archive (``*.a``, static library) from the object files and link "
"it into a firmware (program). This is default behavior of PlatformIO Build "
"System (``\"libArchive\": true``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/libarchive.rst:23
msgid ""
"Setting ``\"libArchive\": false`` will instruct PlatformIO Build System to "
"link object files directly (in-line). This could be useful if you need to "
"override ``weak`` symbols defined in framework or other libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/libarchive.rst:27
msgid ""
"You can disable library archiving globally using :ref:"
"`projectconf_lib_archive` option in :ref:`projectconf`."
msgstr ""
